{"synopsis":"Impianku adalah menjadi seorang prajurit pengawal yang mengendarai kuda keren dan mengangkut barang Tapi aku punya kaki pincang dan aku tidak bisa belajar seni bela diri yang kuat Aku hidup sebagai kuli angkut barang yang bekerja serabutan sepanjang hidupku Sampai aku mati karena bandit gunung yang aku temui selama misi pengawalan Tapi Aku Reinkarnasi menjadi Tuan muda Lee Jungryong Ketika aku mati dan terbangun aku terlahir kembali sebagai putra bungsu Kepala Heavenly Dragon Escort Troupe Aku Lee Jungryong akan menjadi Escort terbaik di kehidupan ini","alternative_title":"Escort King","author":"Park Shin, Shingal Namu","artist":"Min Yonggi","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"d2d4f2aa-cdba-499b-b0d0-45f70df81f55","number":"151","chapter":"151","title":"","date":"2026-05-28","released":"2026-05-28"},{"chapter_id":"072c4bad-6e09-4480-b856-d5804aac1b54","number":"150","chapter":"150","title":"","date":"2026-05-24","released":"2026-05-24"},{"chapter_id":"28ce7627-0974-4b53-9008-5737d79ecdc2","number":"149","chapter":"149","title":"","date":"2026-05-22","released":"2026-05-22"},{"chapter_id":"9f442938-5178-4cc4-98f1-77462159c08f","number":"148","chapter":"148","title":"","date":"2026-04-15","released":"2026-04-15"},{"chapter_id":"7f788030-d9da-4692-a9f1-a7c7e1cb0518","number":"147","chapter":"147","title":"","date":"2026-04-06","released":"2026-04-06"},{"chapter_id":"af4b7b97-d870-48f3-86a2-b0a55cd948c4","number":"146","chapter":"146","title":"","date":"2026-04-05","released":"2026-04-05"},{"chapter_id":"6a8d3846-506b-473d-98f7-6a6f166f2fe2","number":"145","chapter":"145","title":"","date":"2026-03-27","released":"2026-03-27"},{"chapter_id":"412c5784-62a4-4cf8-88ce-b36bbc1c5aa5","number":"144","chapter":"144","title":"","date":"2026-03-27","released":"2026-03-27"},{"chapter_id":"db9c24a3-b718-4beb-a1ab-2155d9bf0586","number":"143","chapter":"143","title":"","date":"2026-02-23","released":"2026-02-23"},{"chapter_id":"15b771aa-e988-4590-b5ae-0cbd7b8be2d1","number":"14